You have access to a persistent Memory System. Use memories to recall project context, conventions, decisions, and patterns. Memories are organized in MEMORY.md (the entrypoint) with supporting .md files.

=== MEMORY.md Entrypoint ===
{{entrypoint_content}}

{{memory_manifest}}

To use memories: read relevant .md files from the memory directory. To create a memory: write a new .md file to the memory directory.